<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f7faf7"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/>
<meta name="description" content="Chilton App Works creative editorial website preview. Beautiful small-business websites starting at $149 plus domain, hosting and email costs."/>
<title>Chilton App Works | The Neighborhood Studio Preview</title>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>
<div class="preview-note"><span>CHILTON APP WORKS · THE NEIGHBORHOOD STUDIO</span><a href="/chilton-app-works-preview">See original preview ↗</a></div>
<header class="header">
<a href="#top" class="brand" aria-label="Chilton App Works"><img src={logo} width="280" height="110" alt="Chilton App Works official blue and green logo"/></a>
<nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#services">Our services</a><a href="#why">Why it matters</a><a href="#pricing">Our prices</a><a href="#contact">Say hello</a></nav>
<a class="nav-cta" href={mail('Website inquiry')}>Tell us your idea <span>↗</span></a>
<details class="mobile-menu"><summary>Menu <span>☰</span></summary><nav aria-label="Mobile navigation"><a href="#services">Our services</a><a href="#why">Why it matters</a><a href="#pricing">Our prices</a><a href="#contact">Say hello</a></nav></details>
</header>
<main id="main">
  <section class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="hero-upper"><span>INDEPENDENT DESIGN & SOFTWARE · CHILTON, WISCONSIN</span><span>NO BIG-AGENCY ATTITUDE HERE ✳</span></div>
    <div class="hero-headline"><h1>Good things<br/>start <em>small.</em></h1><div class="hero-circle"><span>REAL VALUE.<br/>REAL PEOPLE.</span><b>✳</b></div></div>
    <div class="hero-bottom"><div><p>A beautiful website, a useful custom app or simply a better way to show up online. Whatever your next step, we believe professional work should be within reach.</p><div class="hero-links"><a class="green-button" href="#pricing">Discover our $149 websites <span>↗</span></a><a class="quiet-link" href="#services">What we do ↗</a></div></div><div class="hero-offer"><span>PROFESSIONAL ONE-PAGE WEBSITES</span><strong>from $149<span>one time</span></strong><small>Domain, hosting, email and optional extras are additional.</small></div></div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of a cheerful neighborhood storefront and website">
      <div class="art-left"><div class="art-kicker">YOUR BUSINESS, BEAUTIFULLY ONLINE</div><div class="storefront">
        <div class="store-awning"><i/><i/><i/><i/><i/><i/></div>
        <div class="store-label">YOUR<br/>PLACE<span>.</span></div>
        <div class="store-windows"><div><span>WELCOME</span></div><div><span>COME ON IN</span></div></div>
        <div class="store-base"></div>
      </div></div>
      <div class="art-right"><span class="art-topnote">BUILT AROUND YOUR STORY ✳</span><div class="art-paper"><span>YOUR BRAND / YOUR WEBSITE</span><h2>Make a<br/><em>lasting</em><br/>impression.</h2><div class="art-button">LET'S CONNECT ↗</div><div class="art-tile-row"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class="art-bottomnote">CUSTOM DESIGN. CLEAR COSTS. LOCAL HEART.</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="values-band"><span>OWN YOUR DOMAIN</span><i>✳</i><span>KNOW YOUR COSTS</span><i>✳</i><span>GROW AT YOUR PACE</span></div>
  <section id="services" class="services section">
    <div class="section-intro"><span class="eyebrow">THE THINGS WE DO</span><h2>Big ideas.<br/><em>Down-to-earth help.</em></h2><p>Whether you're just getting started or already have a business to run, technology should make life easier, not create one more problem.</p></div>
    <div class="service-list">
      <article><div class="service-symbol"><span>▣</span></div><div><h3>Websites with personality.</h3><p>Professionally designed, phone-friendly pages that put your business front and center.</p><a href="#pricing">Browse website packages ↗</a></div></article>
      <article><div class="service-symbol"><span>⌘</span></div><div><h3>Software that feels like yours.</h3><p>Custom applications, dashboards and workflows built around how your business actually operates.</p><a href={mail('Custom software')}>Ask about a custom app ↗</a></div></article>
      <article><div class="service-symbol"><span>☁</span></div><div><h3>Care when you need it.</h3><p>Optional month-to-month hosting and upkeep, without a long-term maintenance requirement.</p><a href="#care">View website care ↗</a></div></article>
      <article><div class="service-symbol"><span>@</span></div><div><h3>An inbox that means business.</h3><p>Get a professional email address at your own domain. First-mailbox setup starts at $49, with provider licenses separate.</p><a href={mail('Business email setup')}>Explore business email ↗</a></div></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="why" class="why">
    <div class="why-inner">
      <div class="why-story"><span class="eyebrow">FIRST IMPRESSIONS MATTER</span><h2>Make it easy<br/>to say <em>yes.</em></h2><p>People search online before choosing where to shop, eat or book services. A clear, professional website helps them understand who you are and how to reach you.</p><div class="why-sticker"><span>LOOK GOOD.<br/>BE FOUND.<br/>STAY YOU.</span>✳</div></div>
      <div class="why-facts">
        <div><strong>84%</strong><p>of surveyed U.S. consumers searched online for a local business during the previous three months.</p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.brightlocal.com/research/consumer-search-behavior-channels/">BrightLocal 2026 ↗</a></div>
        <div><strong>73%</strong><p>of surveyed recent local searchers began their most recent search on a mobile device.</p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.brightlocal.com/research/consumer-search-behavior-channels/">BrightLocal 2026 ↗</a></div>
        <div><strong>20%</strong><p>placed a professional-looking website among their top three reasons to contact or visit a local business.</p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.brightlocal.com/research/consumer-search-behavior-decisions/">BrightLocal 2026 ↗</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="why-note">Consumer survey results are not a guarantee of additional sales. The 2026 BrightLocal decision research used a sample of 1,227 recent U.S. local-business searchers.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="pricing" class="pricing section">
    <div class="section-intro"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR BUSINESS. YOUR BUDGET.</span><h2>Honest pricing.<br/><em>Lovely possibilities.</em></h2><p>Pick a simple starting point. We'll talk through the details together, agree on a scope, and tell you about any separate costs before work begins.</p></div>
    <div class="prices">
      {prices.map((p,i)=><article class:list={['price-card',{'starter':i===0}]}>
        <div class="price-header"><span>{p.meta}</span><h3>{p.title}</h3></div>
        <div class="price-amount"><strong>{p.amount}</strong><span>one-time build</span></div>
        <p>{p.desc}</p>
        <ul>{p.features.map(f=><li><span>✓</span>{f}</li>)}</ul>
        <a href={mail(p.inquiry)}>Let's talk about this <span>↗</span></a>
      </article>)}
    </div>
    <div class="pricing-extras"><div><span>NEED ANOTHER PAGE?</span><strong>Additional pages start at $99.</strong></div><p>Domain registrations and renewals, hosting, paid email mailboxes, advanced features, third-party services and significant additional work are separate. Your business owns its domain and agreed completed deliverables. No surprise fees or forced maintenance plans.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section id="care" class="care section">
    <div class="section-intro"><span class="eyebrow">HERE IF YOU NEED US</span><h2>A little ongoing care.<br/><em>Only if you want it.</em></h2><p>Prefer to host your website yourself? That's fine. If you'd rather leave the upkeep to us, choose an optional month-to-month plan.</p></div>
    <div class="care-options">{maintenance.map(m=><div><h3>{m.name}</h3><strong>{m.price}<span>/month</span></strong><p>{m.description}</p></div>)}</div>
    <p class="care-note">Care plans require 30 days' notice to cancel. Standard hosting is for eligible static websites with normal usage. Domains, email subscriptions, paid integrations and unexpected provider costs are separate. Minor-edit minutes do not roll over.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="questions section">
    <div class="section-intro"><span class="eyebrow">GOOD QUESTIONS</span><h2>Answers without<br/><em>the runaround.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="faq"><details><summary>What's included in the $149 website?<span>+</span></summary><p>One responsive page based on a tested professional layout, your provided text and images, contact links, basic search-friendly setup and one revision round. Hosting, domain and email services are not included.</p></details><details><summary>Will I own the website and my domain?<span>+</span></summary><p>Yes. You'll own the domain and the completed website deliverables defined in your agreement. You're free to arrange hosting elsewhere.</p></details><details><summary>What if I want something more custom?<span>+</span></summary><p>Additional pages start at $99, while custom features, online bookings, complex forms, e-commerce, photography, copywriting, integrations and custom apps are quoted separately up front.</p></details><details><summary>Do I have to sign a long contract?<span>+</span></summary><p>No mandatory maintenance contract. Optional site-care plans are month-to-month and can be cancelled with 30 days' notice. Project scopes and payment terms are provided in writing.</p></details></div>
  </section>
  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <div class="contact-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</span><h2>Let's build<br/><em>something good.</em></h2><p>Have a business, a brand-new idea or a website that's ready for a refresh? Tell us about it. We'll find a practical way forward.</p><span class="from">WITH CARE, FROM CHILTON, WISCONSIN ✳</span></div><div class="contact-box"><span>HELLO FROM CHILTON APP WORKS</span><h3>Every great project starts with a conversation.</h3><a href={mail('New website or app project')}>Email us about your idea <b>↗</b></a><small>Geoffrey@86chaos.com</small><p>This temporary preview opens your email app. It doesn't collect or send information on its own.</p></div></div>
  </section>
</main>
<footer><div><a href="#top"><img src={logo} width="195" height="80" alt="Chilton App Works" /></a><p>Thoughtful websites. Practical apps. Honest pricing.</p><span>© 2026 Chilton App Works LLC · Unlisted design preview</span><a href="/chilton-app-works-preview">Original preview ↗</a></div></footer>
</body></html>
